ture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/state.json" "file_sha256" "674608c20baa5c1128425f82c7e4bddbd5ccfa579a0a8a8966c395c5497386fe" "basis" 1179 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-69476" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\text{arcsec}(64x)+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/state.json" "file_sha256" "674608c20baa5c1128425f82c7e4bddbd5ccfa579a0a8a8966c395c5497386fe" "basis" 1179 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-69476" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\text{arcsec}(8x)+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/state.json" "file_sha256" "674608c20baa5c1128425f82c7e4bddbd5ccfa579a0a8a8966c395c5497386fe" "basis" 1179 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73718" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{1}{5|x|\\sqrt{25{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/state.json" "file_sha256" "674608c20baa5c1128425f82c7e4bddbd5ccfa579a0a8a8966c395c5497386fe" "basis" 1179 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73718" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{5|x|\\sqrt{25{x}^{2}-1}}=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|5x|\\sqrt{(5x)^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $5x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=5x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{5|x|\\sqrt{25{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{|5x|\\sqrt{(5x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(5x)}{5}+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/state.json" "file_sha256" "674608c20baa5c1128425f82c7e4bddbd5ccfa579a0a8a8966c395c5497386fe" "basis" 1179 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73718" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "f58488b23f0bf4c4f5a30495a2c8a6772ea09cb609f9ecdd35e14c31759c9642" "basis" 1179 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73718" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013963/state.json" "file_sha256" "674608c20baa5c1128425f82c7e4bddbd5ccfa579a0a8a8966c395c5497386fe" "basis" 1179 