/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/state.json" "file_sha256" "0c1681a73dd1fc724fb66e2e506c6e6119ccfd747f9f76c781b5a661e273fcbd" "basis" 1259 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49505" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2x)+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/state.json" "file_sha256" "0c1681a73dd1fc724fb66e2e506c6e6119ccfd747f9f76c781b5a661e273fcbd" "basis" 1259 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49505" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{2})+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/state.json" "file_sha256" "0c1681a73dd1fc724fb66e2e506c6e6119ccfd747f9f76c781b5a661e273fcbd" "basis" 1259 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114056" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int \\frac{8}{|x|\\sqrt{8{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/state.json" "file_sha256" "0c1681a73dd1fc724fb66e2e506c6e6119ccfd747f9f76c781b5a661e273fcbd" "basis" 1259 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114056" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{8}{|x|\\sqrt{8{x}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{8\\sqrt{8}}{|\\sqrt{8}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{8}x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $\\sqrt{8}x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{8}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{8}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{8}{|x|\\sqrt{8{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{8\\sqrt{8}}{|\\sqrt{8}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{8}x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8\\sqrt{8}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =8\\sqrt{8}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =8\\,\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =8\\,\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{8}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/state.json" "file_sha256" "0c1681a73dd1fc724fb66e2e506c6e6119ccfd747f9f76c781b5a661e273fcbd" "basis" 1259 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114056" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037171/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "31e77975055356dfb2474618c3afed650e3c461761c728a631bc7a95a0837710" "basis" 1259 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable