 nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $36{x}^{2}=(6x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=6x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=6\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{6\\sqrt{1-36{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(6x)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\cdot (\\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{36}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{36}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{36}\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/state.json" "file_sha256" "209bc00cb40175a9943a64f62fd3f5191b12be9d808b34cf249d94d8af200e70"} {"question" "q-114023" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "4207968f4e09770be703843106668d261c81eac2351ac6724a5e99fb8a907a0b"} {"question" "q-114023" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/state.json" "file_sha256" "209bc00cb40175a9943a64f62fd3f5191b12be9d808b34cf249d94d8af200e70"} {"question" "q-114023" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "36\\operatorname{arcsi