u}{\\text{d}x}=8\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{8}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}8\\int \\frac{1}{|8x|\\sqrt{(8x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x & =8\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{8}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec}(8x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/state.json" "file_sha256" "209bc00cb40175a9943a64f62fd3f5191b12be9d808b34cf249d94d8af200e70"} {"question" "q-69476" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "4207968f4e09770be703843106668d261c81eac2351ac6724a5e99fb8a907a0b"} {"question" "q-69476" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/state.json" "file_sha256" "209bc00cb40175a9943a64f62fd3f5191b12be9d808b34cf249d94d8af200e70"} {"question" "q-69476" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "4\\text{arcsec}(8x)+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(4x)}{4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(8x)}{8}+C"] ["math" "\\text{arcsec}(64x)+C"] ["math" "\\text{arcsec}(8x)+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/state.json" "file_sha256" "209bc00cb40175a9943a64f62fd3f5191b12be9d808b34cf249d94d8af200e70"} {"question" "q-69476" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\text{arcsec}(8x)+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/state.json" "file_sha256" "209bc00cb40175a9943a64f62fd3f5191b12be9d808b34cf249d94d8af200e70"} {"question" "q-114054" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{6{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/state.json" "file_sha256" "209bc00cb40175a9943a64f62fd3f5191b12be9d808b34cf249d94d8af200e70"} {"question" "q-114054" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|x|\\sqrt{6{x}^{2}-1}}=\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{|\\sqrt{6}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{6}x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $\\sqrt{6}x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{6}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{6}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{6{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{|\\sqrt{6}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{6}x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{6}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14050191/state.json" "file_sha256" "209bc00cb40175a9943a64f62fd3f5